      "source_item": "ITEM_INVITATION",
      "required_items": {
        "ITEM_INVITATION": 1
      },
      "previous": null,
      "exclusive_group": 900100
    },
    {
      "key": "QUEST_WAGON",
      "id": 900102,
      "logical_id": "BS-C01-03",
      "title": "Travelers Who Never Arrived",
      "level": 21,
      "min_level": 20,
      "faction": "Both",
      "description": "Mira, Dorn and Teren were inspecting old trail stones. Their wagon was left uphill from our camp, near the first ash-marked sign. Search it for the travelers' log. Leave what supplies remain for the survivors.",
      "objectives": "Inspect the abandoned wagon above camp and recover its log.",
      "completion": "The spiral again. It was carved into stone that had stood quietly for generations. Our scout has found fresh tracks leading into the valley.",
      "xp_difficulty": 4,
      "money": 600,
      "giver": "NPC_MARUUT",
      "turn_in": "NPC_MARUUT",
      "required_items": {
        "ITEM_LOG": 1
      },
      "previous": null,
      "prerequisite_any": [
        "QUEST_COMMISSION_A",
        "QUEST_COMMISSION_H"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "QUEST_TRAIL",
      "id": 900103,
      "logical_id": "BS-C01-04",
      "title": "Follow the Ash",
      "level": 21,
      "min_level": 20,
      "faction": "Both",
      "description": "Follow the three ash-marked signs from the expedition approach into the Charred Vale. Inspect each one and defeat six Twilight scouts on that route. Recover a copy of their orders as well. We need evidence, not guesses.",
      "objectives": "Inspect all three distinct signs, defeat six Twilight Scouts and recover their coded orders.",
      "completion": "Prisoners, a separate commander, and a watch rotation. Those were not bandits taking whatever they could carry. Someone organized this.",
      "xp_difficulty": 4,
      "money": 600,
      "giver": "NPC_SCOUT",
      "turn_in": "NPC_SCOUT",
      "required_items": {
        "ITEM_ORDERS": 1
      },
      "credits": {
        "NPC_CULT_SCOUT": 6,
        "CREDIT_TRAIL_A": 1,
        "CREDIT_TRAIL_B": 1,
        "CREDIT_TRAIL_C": 1
      },
      "previous": "QUEST_WAGON"
    },
    {
      "key": "QUEST_RESCUE",
      "id": 900104,
      "logical_id": "BS-C01-05",
      "title": "Bring Them Home",
      "level": 22,
      "min_level": 20,
      "faction": "Both",
      "description": "The scouts are holding Mira, Dorn and Teren in three cages below the last trail marker. Free each of them and stay nearby while they reach the expedition refuge marker. Clear trouble from the route; nobody gets left behind.",
      "objectives": "Open each surveyor's cage and accompany them until they reach the marked refuge.",
      "completion": "All three are safe. They remember a spiral carved into the ward stones and a prisoner called Shadowsong. Maruut needs to hear this.",
      "xp_difficulty": 4,
      "money": 600,
      "giver": "NPC_SCOUT",
      "turn_in": "NPC_SCOUT",
      "credits": {
        "CREDIT_CAPTIVE_A": 1,
        "CREDIT_CAPTIVE_B": 1,
        "CREDIT_CAPTIVE_C": 1
      },
      "previous": "QUEST_TRAIL"
    },
    {
      "key": "QUEST_WARDS",
      "id": 900105,
      "logical_id": "BS-C01-06",
      "title": "A Stone That Should Be Quiet",
      "level": 23,
      "min_level": 20,
      "faction": "Both",
      "description": "Our workers saw the cult cutting older runes. Take this tracing kit to the three ward stones west of the prison site. Use it on each distinct stone, then bring me the complete rubbing. Be careful: the stones are already disturbing the earth around them.",
      "objectives": "Trace all three ward stones and recover a complete rubbing. I can replace a lost kit.",
      "completion": "Those are deliberate cuts. The new spiral interrupts the old pattern at exactly the points it needs. Ortell knows the people who use that sign.",
      "xp_difficulty": 4,
      "money": 600,
      "giver": "NPC_MARUUT",
      "turn_in": "NPC_MARUUT",
      "source_item": "ITEM_TRACING_KIT",
      "required_items": {
        "ITEM_RUBBING": 1
      },
      "credits": {
        "CREDIT_WARD_A": 1,
        "CREDIT_WARD_B": 1,
        "CREDIT_WARD_C": 1
      },
      "previous": "QUEST_RESCUE"
    },
    {
      "key": "QUEST_COMPARE",
      "id": 900106,
      "logical_id": "BS-C01-07",
      "title": "The Same Hand",
      "level": 23,
      "min_level": 20,
      "faction": "Both",
      "description": "Ortell once knew the Twilight's Hammer from the inside. He is helping us now. Speak with him here in camp and compare the deposited orders with the ward rubbing. You do not need to carry those papers back and forth; I have sent him copies.",
      "objectives": "Ask Ortell to compare the orders and the rubbing.",
      "completion": "The hand that wrote the orders also marked the stone. That spiral is an instruction, not a decoration. We must find out what else they intend to break.",
      "xp_difficulty": 2,
      "money": 600,
      "giver": "NPC_MARUUT",
      "turn_in": "NPC_ORTELL",
      "credits": {
        "CREDIT_COMPARE": 1
      },
      "previous": "QUEST_WARDS"
    },
    {
      "key": "QUEST_COMMANDER",
      "id": 900107,
      "logical_id": "BS-C01-08",
      "title": "A Captive Commander",
      "level": 24,
      "min_level": 20,
      "faction": "Both",
      "description": "The rescued surveyors recognized the commander's name: Jarod Shadowsong. The cult is holding him at an altar beyond their cages. Observe it from the concealed stone marker to the west. Remain quiet and out of combat. Do not charge the altar; we need to know he is alive before we plan a rescue.",
      "objectives": "Remain at the concealed observation point until you can confirm Jarod is alive.",
      "completion": "Alive, guarded, and kept apart from the workers. They are preparing something public. A direct assault would give them time to kill him.",
      "xp_difficulty": 4,
      "money": 600,
      "giver": "NPC_ORTELL",
      "turn_in": "NPC_ORTELL",
      "credits": {
        "CREDIT_COMMANDER": 1
      },
      "previous": "QUEST_COMPARE"
    },
    {
      "key": "QUEST_RECRUIT",
      "id": 900108,
      "logical_id": "BS-C01-09",
      "title": "The Name on the Papers",
      "level": 25,
      "min_level": 20,
      "faction": "Both",
      "description": "There is a recruit moving between the watch posts beside the prison site. Use my dead drop south of the observation point and watch a full change of position without entering combat. Then return and agree the signal with me. We will need papers and patience to get inside.",
      "objectives": "Watch the recruit's change from the dead drop, then agree the extraction signal with me.",
      "completion": "Two short knocks, then a pause. If the wrong person answers, you walk away. You have earned this signet, and the expedition's trust. Speak with me again once you reach level twenty-five; entering the cult will require a steadier hand.",
      "xp_difficulty": 2,
      "money": 600,
      "giver": "NPC_ORTELL",
      "turn_in": "NPC_ORTELL",
      "credits": {
        "CREDIT_RECRUIT": 1,
        "CREDIT_SIGNAL": 1
      },
