  "npc_texts": {
    "NPC_MARUUT": "Old stones do not start speaking without a reason. Help us find our missing people, and we will learn who disturbed them.",
    "NPC_ORTELL": "The Twilight's Hammer rewards certainty. Inside their camps, doubt is best kept behind your teeth.",
    "NPC_SCOUT": "Fresh ash, bootprints, and a trail nobody wants to explain. Stay alert on the descent.",
    "NPC_COURIER_A": "A neutral expedition needs someone who can see past the color of a banner.",
    "NPC_COURIER_H": "The invitation is for a willing traveler. The missing people need help, not another argument about borders."
  },
